WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 23

01:45.940 --> 01:47.860
You're lucky that you're still alive.

01:47.860 --> 01:49.430
You should know that martial
arts master above the Ninth Dan

01:49.450 --> 01:50.730
can hear another man's breath

01:50.730 --> 01:53.390
through the wall.

01:53.410 --> 01:54.920
They can figure out my position

01:54.940 --> 01:57.310
by my voice,

01:57.330 --> 02:01.200
and then they'll shoot you.

02:01.940 --> 02:04.390
Distinguishing location by breaths through the wall,

02:04.410 --> 02:06.170
it doesn't make sense.

02:06.220 --> 02:09.330
They're beyond common sense.

02:11.370 --> 02:13.170
Aren't you thirsty?

02:13.420 --> 02:14.730
Your Majesty,

02:14.820 --> 02:16.370
meeting you is like having a
good rain after a long drought.

02:16.370 --> 02:17.760
I'm no longer thirsty.

02:19.090 --> 02:20.610
You've also heard that

02:21.540 --> 02:23.420
this residence will be heavily guarded

02:23.420 --> 02:25.040
in future.

02:25.850 --> 02:27.550
Don't break into other's residence

02:27.570 --> 02:29.640
ever again.

02:32.370 --> 02:33.610
Yes.

02:33.650 --> 02:34.960
Are you free tomorrow?

02:34.980 --> 02:36.370
Probably.

02:36.820 --> 02:38.330
Come to the imperial palace.

02:38.820 --> 02:40.710
Your marriage with Wan'er

02:40.730 --> 02:42.530
is settled.

02:42.700 --> 02:44.900
Wan'er has grown up in the imperial palace.

02:44.900 --> 02:47.920
The Empress Dowager and my consorts all like her.

02:48.780 --> 02:51.610
You should meet them.

02:52.260 --> 02:53.350
I see.

02:53.370 --> 02:55.370
Fine. You can leave.

03:23.120 --> 03:27.750
=Taiping Residence=

03:33.780 --> 03:34.960
Director Yan?

03:34.980 --> 03:36.520
I heard that you killed Cheng Jushu.

03:36.540 --> 03:37.890
That's right.

03:38.650 --> 03:39.900
How could you kill an Eighth Dan martial arts master?

03:39.900 --> 03:41.000
I was lucky.

03:42.820 --> 03:44.350
Who's that archer outside the yard?

03:44.370 --> 03:46.840
What archer? I've no idea.

03:47.060 --> 03:49.970
You'd better answer my question honestly.

03:56.620 --> 03:58.320
His Majesty just told you

03:58.340 --> 04:00.920
to let me pass.

04:00.980 --> 04:03.170
Director Yan, are you going to defy the imperial order?

04:10.090 --> 04:10.930
I'll remember you.

04:10.930 --> 04:12.280
See you.

04:31.930 --> 04:33.200
Brother!

04:33.610 --> 04:35.200
What happened?

04:36.490 --> 04:38.010
The archer is so good!

04:38.050 --> 04:40.010
He broke off the tree with arrows.

04:41.930 --> 04:43.480
Where's Uncle Wuzhu?

04:45.370 --> 04:46.530
He's gone.

04:47.770 --> 04:49.400
Never mind. That's his style.

04:49.420 --> 04:50.870
Have you found the key?

04:50.890 --> 04:52.090
No.

04:52.170 --> 04:53.690
I met His Majesty instead.

04:54.020 --> 04:55.190
His Majesty?

04:55.210 --> 04:56.760
His Majesty is inside?

04:57.540 --> 04:59.070
He seems to know my mom well.

04:59.090 --> 05:00.240
Have you asked him about her?

05:00.260 --> 05:01.850
He wouldn't tell me.

05:03.170 --> 05:05.480
Let's go. Wan'er should be worried.

05:12.370 --> 05:14.070
The Crown Prince was taken?!

05:14.090 --> 05:16.970
It's fine. My father planned it.

05:17.740 --> 05:20.160
Your father wants to take the Crown Prince?!

05:20.490 --> 05:22.000
They've taken the wrong person.

05:22.020 --> 05:26.810
Actually, you're the one he wants to test.

05:30.610 --> 05:32.070
He wants to know

05:32.090 --> 05:33.490
whether you have a Great Master

05:33.490 --> 05:35.250
by your side or not.

05:36.090 --> 05:37.850
He's still suspicious of me.

05:37.930 --> 05:39.170
My third cousin said

05:39.170 --> 05:40.870
you are not the murderer.

05:40.890 --> 05:42.190
You actually hid that

05:42.210 --> 05:44.530
from my brother the whole way!

05:45.860 --> 05:48.370
I'll apologize to you later.

05:49.210 --> 05:50.370
You'd better take Dabao back

05:50.370 --> 05:51.260
at once.

05:51.260 --> 05:52.630
My third cousin said that

05:52.650 --> 05:54.190
by telling my father the following words,

05:54.210 --> 05:55.260
he'll know the murderer

05:55.260 --> 05:56.300
naturally.

05:56.300 --> 05:57.810
What did the Crown Prince say?

06:00.820 --> 06:01.970
No!

06:02.050 --> 06:03.890
My eyes! My eyes!

06:03.890 --> 06:05.320
What's wrong with your eyes?

06:06.050 --> 06:07.070
I fooled you.

06:07.090 --> 06:09.760
Little one! Little one!

06:10.580 --> 06:11.720
Fan Xian.

06:13.050 --> 06:14.440
Why do you follow me?

06:15.740 --> 06:17.000
I trust you.

06:17.020 --> 06:19.090
I believe Wan'er trusts you, too.

06:19.330 --> 06:21.600
As to what happened today, she must have her difficulties.

06:21.890 --> 06:22.650
Don't hate her

06:22.650 --> 06:24.410
for that.

06:26.090 --> 06:27.050
Does my love for Wan'er

06:27.050 --> 06:29.250
seem so frangible?

06:33.490 --> 06:36.320
Don't worry. I know that.

06:38.930 --> 06:40.970
Little one! Little one!

06:41.090 --> 06:42.070
-Little one! -Dabao!

06:42.090 --> 06:43.000
Little one!

06:43.020 --> 06:44.000
Dabao!

06:44.020 --> 06:46.440
Xianxian, get down and play with us.

06:46.460 --> 06:47.910
Dabao, let me take you home.

06:47.930 --> 06:49.200
Get down and play with us.

06:49.650 --> 06:50.520
It's about time.

06:50.540 --> 06:51.880
Let me take you home.

06:53.650 --> 06:55.290
We can come out for dinner another day.

06:57.580 --> 06:58.800
Sister,

06:58.820 --> 07:00.970
will you also escort me home?

07:02.540 --> 07:03.310
That's OK.

07:03.330 --> 07:05.000
I can escort you home with Fan Xian.

07:05.020 --> 07:05.700
Good! Good!

07:05.700 --> 07:07.600
Then let's go home! Let's go!

07:27.140 --> 07:28.440
Ruoruo,

07:28.540 --> 07:30.070
do me a favor.

07:30.090 --> 07:31.480
What is it?

07:52.890 --> 07:54.490
The guys we sent to test Fan Xian

07:54.490 --> 07:55.600
are back.

07:59.140 --> 08:00.640
Prime Minister, you don't have to show up.

08:00.890 --> 08:02.370
Let me meet him instead.

08:02.580 --> 08:06.320
Thank you, Master. Please figure out the truth.

08:25.610 --> 08:26.920
Master.

08:28.580 --> 08:29.440
How's it going?

08:29.460 --> 08:30.750
We captured Fan Xian

08:30.770 --> 08:31.460
and detained him in the capital city.

08:31.460 --> 08:32.960
Master, please go and see him.

08:33.290 --> 08:34.580
I asked you to find out

08:34.580 --> 08:36.010
whether he has a martial arts master by his side or not.

08:36.050 --> 08:38.240
Why did you take him into the capital city?

08:38.260 --> 08:39.590
We didn't see the martial arts master,

08:39.610 --> 08:40.370
but he figured out that

08:40.370 --> 08:41.640
we take orders from the Prime Minister.

08:41.660 --> 08:43.560
He requested to see the Prime Minister all the way.

08:43.580 --> 08:44.100
Did you admit your identity?

08:44.100 --> 08:44.700
No! No!

08:44.700 --> 08:45.510
Of course I didn't.

08:45.530 --> 08:46.700
We just detained him

08:46.700 --> 08:47.490
to wait for your order.

08:47.490 --> 08:49.250
Isn't that the same as admitting your identity?

08:49.410 --> 08:50.720
I can't meet him in person.

08:52.290 --> 08:54.200
Release Fan Xian immediately.

08:54.220 --> 08:55.270
After all, he's an official.

08:55.290 --> 08:56.270
If it turns into a big mess,

08:56.290 --> 08:57.680
we won't be able to justify ourselves.

08:57.700 --> 08:58.640
OK! OK! OK!

08:58.660 --> 09:00.130
Master Yuan, good day.

09:00.700 --> 09:01.890
Dabao, good day.

09:02.780 --> 09:04.080
-Let's go. -Good day, Master Yuan.

09:04.460 --> 09:05.570
Let's go.

09:06.370 --> 09:07.240
This is the study.

09:07.260 --> 09:07.830
Master,

09:07.850 --> 09:08.820
should I release Fan Xian

09:08.820 --> 09:10.320
now?

09:10.340 --> 09:11.030
Release whom?

09:11.050 --> 09:12.210
Fan Xian of course.

09:13.290 --> 09:14.960
Then who's that?

09:15.660 --> 09:17.960
I've never met him. Who's that?

09:18.930 --> 09:21.480
Who on earth did you capture?

09:21.660 --> 09:23.290
Dad, Xianxian and Wan'er

09:23.290 --> 09:24.460
were both there.

09:24.460 --> 09:25.340
Then they just

09:25.340 --> 09:26.320
sat there and talked.

09:26.340 --> 09:26.930
Later,

09:26.930 --> 09:28.850
a little one came.

09:28.850 --> 09:29.580
The little one and I,

09:29.580 --> 09:30.780
we caught fish

09:30.780 --> 09:32.290
by the pond.

09:32.290 --> 09:33.780
Then we played stone skimming.

09:33.780 --> 09:35.440
Right! We even had a competition.

09:35.460 --> 09:36.510
Dad, I won!

09:36.530 --> 09:37.800
Later,

09:37.820 --> 09:39.970
we also poked worm holes.

09:39.970 --> 09:40.910
Then...

09:40.930 --> 09:41.700
I washed my hands, Dad.

09:41.700 --> 09:42.800
-Look! -Good! Good! Good!

09:42.820 --> 09:43.950
-I washed them clean. -Good! Good! Good!

09:43.970 --> 09:45.560
Come on. Drink some water first.

09:45.580 --> 09:46.810
Thank you, Dad.

09:50.410 --> 09:51.570
Dad,

09:53.580 --> 09:54.800
there are a lot of people in white

09:54.820 --> 09:56.480
in the front yard.

09:57.100 --> 09:58.920
Many of them are crying.

10:00.260 --> 10:01.810
They're having a funeral.

10:02.660 --> 10:04.010
A funeral?

10:05.610 --> 10:07.330
I've never seen one.

10:08.370 --> 10:10.210
Then go and see it yourself.

10:10.580 --> 10:12.820
In the main hall of the front yard lies

10:12.820 --> 10:14.330
a big wooden box.

10:15.340 --> 10:16.810
Go and kowtow to it.

10:17.370 --> 10:18.690
Why?

10:19.100 --> 10:22.330
It's the rule. Everyone should do it.

10:23.900 --> 10:24.700
Xianxian,

10:24.700 --> 10:26.400
will you go with me?

10:30.490 --> 10:32.760
Then you can talk with my dad here.

10:32.780 --> 10:34.480
I'll come back to you in a while.

10:40.260 --> 10:41.570
Take a seat.

10:45.020 --> 10:46.520
Why do you send Dabao back

10:46.730 --> 10:48.650
so early?

10:53.260 --> 10:55.160
Wan'er told me everything.

10:58.930 --> 11:00.210
Really?

11:01.780 --> 11:03.400
I understand.

11:03.850 --> 11:06.690
You have to figure out who murdered your son.

11:08.020 --> 11:09.600
Drink some tea.

11:20.100 --> 11:21.390
The Crown Prince came to see me.

11:21.410 --> 11:24.400
He asked me to tell you the following words.

11:25.100 --> 11:26.320
He said that after hearing the words,

11:26.340 --> 11:28.370
you'll know the murderer naturally.

11:28.580 --> 11:30.210
What did he say?

11:30.610 --> 11:33.650
The murderer is a Great Master.

11:40.820 --> 11:43.810
If the murderer is close to the level of Great Master,

11:44.970 --> 11:48.030
then he could be anyone above the Ninth Dan.

11:48.050 --> 11:51.480
But now, the murderer

11:52.780 --> 11:56.030
is limited to the Four Great Masters.

11:56.050 --> 11:57.890
Can't there be a fifth one?

11:58.410 --> 12:00.650
Impossible!

12:02.340 --> 12:04.210
I've had it investigated that

12:04.260 --> 12:05.810
when it happened,

12:05.970 --> 12:09.130
Ye Liuyun, Ku He and Si Gujian

12:09.170 --> 12:11.480
were not around the capital city.

12:12.460 --> 12:14.330
I guessed right.

12:15.410 --> 12:19.570
The Great Master inside the
imperial palace is the murderer.

12:19.730 --> 12:21.600
Under whose order?

12:22.780 --> 12:26.720
His Majesty, Her Majesty, the Empress Dowager,

12:26.820 --> 12:29.240
the Princess Royal, the Second Prince, or the Crown Prince.

12:29.260 --> 12:30.890
It could be anyone.

12:33.460 --> 12:35.770
Since the Crown Prince gave us the information,

12:37.100 --> 12:39.130
it might not be him.

12:39.660 --> 12:40.460
Isn't the Princess Royal

12:40.460 --> 12:42.010
the birth mother of Wan'er?

12:43.700 --> 12:45.600
That woman

12:46.660 --> 12:48.840
is crazy.

12:51.700 --> 12:53.800
Since the imperial palace is involved,

12:53.820 --> 12:55.600
why did the Crown Prince tell us?

13:00.020 --> 13:01.280
Prime Minister.

13:12.170 --> 13:14.330
To figure it out,

13:15.020 --> 13:18.040
we might as well ask him about it.

13:22.930 --> 13:24.840
Our men

13:25.370 --> 13:27.830
captured him accidentally.

13:27.850 --> 13:29.240
I heard that from Wan'er.

13:29.260 --> 13:31.150
Haven't you released him yet?

13:31.170 --> 13:32.920
He requested to see me.

13:32.970 --> 13:35.560
And you also.

13:35.580 --> 13:36.890
See me?

14:38.170 --> 14:39.400
Master Yuan,

14:40.530 --> 14:42.400
which sin have we committed

14:42.780 --> 14:44.270
by abducting the Crown Prince?

14:44.290 --> 14:45.720
Guard outside.

14:46.170 --> 14:47.770
You won't be blamed.

14:54.140 --> 14:55.960
Your Highness, I...

14:56.100 --> 14:58.370
No need to adhere to the formalities
rigidly. And no need to explain.

14:58.610 --> 15:00.160
I've known it all.

15:02.340 --> 15:03.320
Prime Minister,

15:03.340 --> 15:05.210
have you received my elegiac couplet

15:05.290 --> 15:06.770
for the Second Young Master?

15:08.260 --> 15:09.920
How can you be so sure that

15:10.260 --> 15:12.880
the murderer is a Great Master?

15:12.900 --> 15:15.120
The Investigator's Office produced

15:15.140 --> 15:17.320
two files to record the death cause of your son.

15:17.340 --> 15:19.280
The one sent to the imperial palace

15:19.410 --> 15:21.400
tells the real truth.

15:23.530 --> 15:24.960
Why do you

15:25.700 --> 15:27.720
tell me?

15:30.930 --> 15:33.720
Isolated and helpless as I am in the imperial court,

15:33.850 --> 15:35.840
I want to form an alliance with you.

15:35.930 --> 15:38.920
Your Highness, you're dignified and
respected all over the country

15:39.050 --> 15:41.480
with numerous talents under your command.

15:41.820 --> 15:46.130
Why do you want me as an ally?

15:47.610 --> 15:49.960
I know what I really have.

15:50.020 --> 15:52.000
I have many followers,

15:52.020 --> 15:54.280
but none of them holds an
important place in the Six Ministries.

15:54.370 --> 15:56.560
His Majesty and the Empress Dowager

15:56.580 --> 15:58.150
don't favor me.

15:58.170 --> 15:59.710
Now Chengze instead

15:59.730 --> 16:01.440
is gaining more respect and support.

16:01.460 --> 16:03.520
Who knows when

16:04.140 --> 16:06.280
I'll have to hand my position

16:07.170 --> 16:09.400
as the Crown Prince over to him.

16:11.610 --> 16:13.840
What can I do for you?

16:14.020 --> 16:16.120
You are the head of the officials.

16:16.140 --> 16:17.570
Only by joining hands together

16:18.100 --> 16:20.450
can we stand a chance.

16:29.460 --> 16:31.760
Why are you still hesitating?

16:31.780 --> 16:32.910
Your son's death is definitely ordered

16:32.930 --> 16:34.510
by someone in the imperial palace.

16:34.530 --> 16:36.080
Only by joining hands with me

16:36.100 --> 16:37.140
can you figure out the truth,

16:37.140 --> 16:38.200
find the real murderer,

16:38.220 --> 16:40.690
and avenge your son's death.

16:40.970 --> 16:43.040
What if His Majesty is the one

16:44.780 --> 16:47.040
who ordered his death?

16:53.370 --> 16:54.810
I just said

16:55.370 --> 16:59.600
you could avenge your son's death.

17:04.890 --> 17:09.390
No word should be left concerning our alliance.

17:09.410 --> 17:10.750
Of course.

17:10.770 --> 17:13.080
It's OK as long as we reach consensus in heart.

17:17.010 --> 17:18.680
Why do you

17:18.930 --> 17:20.800
ask Fan Xian over specially?

17:20.820 --> 17:23.170
Prime Minister, he's the one

17:23.860 --> 17:25.270
we should fully support in future.

17:25.290 --> 17:26.890
Your Highness, you mean...

17:28.860 --> 17:30.030
As to our war against Beiqi,

17:30.050 --> 17:31.840
we've already captured one prefecture.

17:31.860 --> 17:33.600
The two sides called a truce in the
frontline the day before yesterday.

17:33.620 --> 17:34.840
The Beiqi mission

17:34.860 --> 17:36.870
are on their way to the capital city.

17:36.890 --> 17:38.150
Why am I related?

17:38.170 --> 17:39.360
This war is started

17:39.380 --> 17:42.150
by your investigation on Si Lili.

17:42.170 --> 17:43.230
That is to say,

17:43.250 --> 17:45.130
you've owned the top prize.

17:46.410 --> 17:48.370
We may have disputes,

17:48.460 --> 17:49.680
but we've never born

17:49.700 --> 17:51.480
a deep grudge against each other.

17:51.650 --> 17:54.410
You're talented, and I cherish talents.

17:54.890 --> 17:56.600
Why not join me?

17:57.930 --> 18:01.150
The Neiku will be handed over to you eventually,

18:01.170 --> 18:02.840
and I can let you have it.

18:02.860 --> 18:03.750
From today on,

18:03.770 --> 18:06.200
the Prime Minister and I

18:06.380 --> 18:08.270
will both be your support.

18:08.290 --> 18:10.170
We'll promise you a brilliant future.

18:19.530 --> 18:21.030
Think it over.

18:21.050 --> 18:22.600
We are still young.

18:22.620 --> 18:24.080
When I ascend the throne,

18:24.130 --> 18:25.770
we might make a much-told story
of the emperor and his subject

18:25.770 --> 18:29.320
fighting together from the start to the end.

18:33.770 --> 18:36.080
Be quiet outside!

18:39.340 --> 18:41.230
They have no rules!

18:41.250 --> 18:43.250
What on earth is happening outside?!

19:07.220 --> 19:08.340
Your men are here to rescue you.

19:08.340 --> 19:09.910
Impossible!

19:09.930 --> 19:11.270
What happened?

19:11.290 --> 19:12.560
Your Highness, please stay inside.

19:12.580 --> 19:14.270
The guards outside were slaughtered brutally.

19:14.290 --> 19:16.650
They must be killed by martial arts masters.

19:22.980 --> 19:24.200
Where are you going?

19:24.340 --> 19:25.200
Go out and see what's going on.

19:25.220 --> 19:26.440
It's dangerous.

19:26.460 --> 19:28.080
I'm the only one here who can practice martial arts.

19:28.100 --> 19:29.800
Or shall we let His Highness go out?

20:32.500 --> 20:33.840
Xie Bi'an.

20:33.860 --> 20:36.270
I heard that you are endowed with civil and martial virtues.

20:36.290 --> 20:38.250
Maybe we should compete with other swords.

20:39.460 --> 20:40.930
Don't blame him.

20:49.170 --> 20:51.130
Xie Bi'an is born with a poker face.

20:51.170 --> 20:53.080
He never said anything nice to me.

20:53.890 --> 20:55.200
I didn't expect that

20:55.980 --> 20:56.960
you would come.

20:56.980 --> 20:58.650
Neither do I.

21:05.170 --> 21:07.080
Don't listen to that one inside.

21:07.100 --> 21:09.150
He's always a persuasive talker.

21:09.170 --> 21:10.840
I didn't hear anything.

21:12.130 --> 21:13.560
Let's go inside.

21:18.250 --> 21:20.250
It's slippery. Slow down.

21:27.860 --> 21:29.440
Sorry for coming late.

21:29.460 --> 21:31.680
Your Highness, please forgive me.

21:31.700 --> 21:33.680
Why are you here?

21:35.820 --> 21:37.560
I was burning with anxiety

21:37.580 --> 21:38.720
after hearing that Your Highness was abducted,

21:38.740 --> 21:40.960
so I took Xie Bi'an with me to rescue you.

21:40.980 --> 21:42.560
But don't worry, Your Highness.

21:42.580 --> 21:44.150
The bandits outside

21:44.170 --> 21:47.800
were all killed by Xie Bi'an.

21:52.650 --> 21:54.720
Prime Minister, are you also here to rescue His Highness?

21:55.130 --> 21:56.530
I just passed by.

21:56.770 --> 21:58.600
Do you know the bandits outside?

21:59.290 --> 22:00.600
I've never met them.

22:00.620 --> 22:01.750
Then I'm relieved.

22:01.770 --> 22:02.860
I was worried that

22:02.860 --> 22:04.320
reckless as Xie Bi'an is,

22:04.340 --> 22:06.290
he might hurt our men.

22:07.290 --> 22:09.320
Your Highness, you're so kind.

22:09.340 --> 22:11.320
How admirable!

22:11.500 --> 22:12.770
I'm so flattered.

22:13.650 --> 22:16.200
Now that the Crown Prince is safe,

22:16.380 --> 22:20.200
I'll leave first.

22:35.770 --> 22:37.390
Your sword is nice.

22:37.410 --> 22:38.800
How much is it?

22:43.340 --> 22:44.050
Let's go.

22:44.050 --> 22:45.250
OK.

22:46.620 --> 22:47.930
Nice sword.

22:55.220 --> 22:57.290
You're really watching me closely all the time!

22:59.410 --> 23:01.680
Your Highness, you're the Crown Prince

23:01.700 --> 23:03.150
and my brother as well.

23:03.170 --> 23:04.680
How can I not try my best

23:04.700 --> 23:06.250
to protect your safety?

23:06.250 --> 23:09.370
What a nice brother!

23:09.860 --> 23:12.030
I'm so touched!

23:12.050 --> 23:13.600
It's my duty.

23:14.380 --> 23:16.320
But Your Highness, do feel relieved.

23:16.340 --> 23:17.800
I've been keeping an eye on

23:17.820 --> 23:18.580
the capital city

23:18.580 --> 23:20.270
on your behalf.

23:20.290 --> 23:22.360
Any sign of disturbance

23:22.380 --> 23:24.130
won't escape my eyes.

23:27.650 --> 23:30.080
Then I'm relieved.

23:30.100 --> 23:31.010
May I escort Your Highness

23:31.010 --> 23:32.250
back to the Eastern Palace?

23:32.890 --> 23:34.680
You're most welcome.

23:50.860 --> 23:52.480
Why is the Second Prince coming so fast?

23:53.220 --> 23:54.390
They are

23:54.410 --> 23:56.440
really competing fiercely.

23:56.460 --> 23:58.200
Uncle, will you really ally with the Crown Prince?

23:58.220 --> 23:59.720
I was just saying.

24:00.100 --> 24:02.370
It's better not to offend either of them.

24:02.580 --> 24:04.560
Now the imperial court is in chaos.

24:04.580 --> 24:06.230
We can take this chance

24:06.250 --> 24:08.170
and get you a higher rank.

24:11.220 --> 24:12.870
This time, I really mean it.

24:12.890 --> 24:14.480
No more suspicions.

24:15.050 --> 24:16.440
I just don't know

24:16.500 --> 24:18.440
how much time I've left.

24:19.220 --> 24:20.130
But Uncle,

24:20.130 --> 24:21.560
you look healthy.

24:22.620 --> 24:24.320
I won't die for the moment.

24:24.820 --> 24:27.010
I mean how long can I

24:27.340 --> 24:29.250
keep my position?

24:30.860 --> 24:33.840
Actually, being an official is like being a man.

24:33.860 --> 24:36.560
It's like standing on the top of a mountain.

24:36.700 --> 24:39.720
The further you move forward,
the more cautious you should be.

24:39.740 --> 24:43.440
Otherwise, you'll be doomed eternally.

24:46.100 --> 24:47.600
Can I retreat on my own?

24:48.860 --> 24:52.680
You can't once you go up.

24:52.860 --> 24:54.290
Prime Minister.

24:57.700 --> 24:59.080
They were all killed.

24:59.460 --> 25:01.200
No one was left alive.

25:01.380 --> 25:03.440
All their families are outside the capital city.

25:04.290 --> 25:05.770
Don't bury them.

25:06.290 --> 25:08.770
We can't afford to take any risk.

25:08.820 --> 25:10.840
Help their families settle down well.

25:16.700 --> 25:18.650
Don't blame me for being merciless.

25:19.050 --> 25:22.770
If I'm softhearted, I might endanger myself.

25:23.130 --> 25:24.750
Well, enough for today.

25:24.770 --> 25:26.800
You've been through a lot today.

25:27.340 --> 25:28.800
Go back early.

26:22.050 --> 26:23.410
Uncle.

26:24.220 --> 26:25.230
You're here.

26:25.250 --> 26:26.890
You're upset.

26:27.250 --> 26:29.560
So many things happened today.

26:29.820 --> 26:31.390
The powerful arrow of Yan Xiaoyi.

26:31.410 --> 26:33.030
The brutality of Xie Bi'an.

26:33.050 --> 26:35.290
Running into His Majesty in the Taiping Residence.

26:35.500 --> 26:36.770
Removing Lin Ruofu's suspicion

26:36.770 --> 26:38.270
of me completely.

26:38.290 --> 26:39.440
Also,

26:39.530 --> 26:40.680
the Second Prince and the Crown Prince

26:40.700 --> 26:41.910
are standing in sharp opposition to each other.

26:41.930 --> 26:44.010
Which one upsets you?

26:47.010 --> 26:49.010
The Crown Prince is trying to draw me over to his side.

26:49.170 --> 26:50.460
We may have disputes,

26:50.460 --> 26:52.720
but we've never born a deep grudge against each other.

26:52.930 --> 26:55.720
You're talented, and I cherish talents.

26:56.530 --> 26:58.370
Why not join me?

26:59.170 --> 27:00.720
What's wrong?

27:01.700 --> 27:03.270
We used to believe that

27:03.290 --> 27:05.320
Lin Gong planned the Niulan Street assassination

27:05.340 --> 27:07.200
at the command of the Crown Prince.

27:07.250 --> 27:08.720
But now

27:09.130 --> 27:10.380
he actually said he had never

27:10.380 --> 27:11.840
born a deep grudge against me.

27:11.860 --> 27:13.890
Maybe he believes you don't know the truth.

27:14.460 --> 27:15.530
The news that Lin Gong tried to assassinate me

27:15.530 --> 27:17.170
has spread all over the capital city.

27:18.290 --> 27:20.170
If the Crown Prince is really behind it,

27:21.010 --> 27:22.110
he won't lay down his guard against me

27:22.130 --> 27:23.390
so easily.

27:23.410 --> 27:24.960
Maybe he doesn't mean it.

27:24.980 --> 27:26.600
He asked to see me specially.

27:26.740 --> 27:28.320
Judged from his look,

27:28.340 --> 27:29.870
he really wants to draw me over to his side.

27:29.890 --> 27:31.030
So?

27:31.050 --> 27:33.170
So I've been wondering

27:33.770 --> 27:34.890
what if

27:34.890 --> 27:36.560
the Crown Prince

27:38.410 --> 27:39.930
didn't give the order.

27:40.290 --> 27:41.720
Then who would it be?

27:43.340 --> 27:45.930
I also want to know.

27:50.650 --> 27:52.080
If you can't figure it out now,

27:53.290 --> 27:54.960
just think about it some other day.

27:59.410 --> 27:59.930
Sometimes,

27:59.930 --> 28:02.130
I do envy your character.

28:02.410 --> 28:03.720
It doesn't suit you.

28:03.740 --> 28:05.410
Indeed!

28:05.460 --> 28:06.560
Have you found the key?

28:06.580 --> 28:07.800
No.

28:08.700 --> 28:09.990
Then it must be kept in the imperial palace.

28:10.010 --> 28:12.080
Most of your mom's things

28:12.100 --> 28:14.200
are kept by that old lady.

28:15.100 --> 28:16.680
Which old lady?

28:19.410 --> 28:20.490
The Empress Dowager.

28:23.620 --> 28:25.130
Once we confirm its location,

28:25.460 --> 28:27.010
the rest is easy.

28:27.740 --> 28:29.150
The only problem

28:29.170 --> 28:31.200
is that Great Master Hong Sixiang in the imperial palace.

28:31.740 --> 28:33.200
Is he a guard beside His Majesty?

28:33.220 --> 28:35.010
He guards right beside the Empress Dowager.

28:38.820 --> 28:39.500
Nothing is worse

28:39.500 --> 28:41.480
than that.

29:01.580 --> 29:02.720
The mosquito bites

29:02.740 --> 29:04.230
are really itchy.

29:04.250 --> 29:05.770
They sure are.

29:07.770 --> 29:09.150
Look, there's no mosquito

29:09.170 --> 29:10.800
around the Empress Dowager.

29:10.820 --> 29:11.960
Eunuch Hong is there.

29:11.980 --> 29:13.560
How dare the mosquitoes go there?

29:16.220 --> 29:18.320
By then, we'll adopt our strategy today.

29:19.290 --> 29:20.200
What strategy?

29:20.220 --> 29:21.560
I will hold the Great Master,

29:21.580 --> 29:23.080
and you will go inside to find the key.

29:23.410 --> 29:24.600
Uncle.

29:24.620 --> 29:26.320
Besides the Great Master,

29:26.340 --> 29:27.720
Yan Xiaoyi, the Director of Imperial Guards,

29:27.740 --> 29:28.960
also guards the imperial palace

29:28.980 --> 29:30.290
all the year round.

29:40.500 --> 29:42.010
Just go and find the key.

29:42.650 --> 29:43.840
You really trust me so much?

29:43.860 --> 29:45.930
In this world, I can trust no one

29:45.980 --> 29:47.560
but you.

29:53.700 --> 29:55.050
Uncle,

29:56.890 --> 30:00.080
have you ever felt lonely?

30:00.340 --> 30:01.680
No.

30:01.740 --> 30:03.370
Even after my mom

30:03.500 --> 30:04.960
passed away?

30:06.530 --> 30:07.930
Right.

30:11.220 --> 30:12.770
When you get old,

30:13.580 --> 30:15.050
I'll be there for you.

30:15.980 --> 30:17.680
I probably won't get old.

30:19.410 --> 30:21.080
Then when I get old,

30:21.100 --> 30:22.650
you should be there for me.

30:23.050 --> 30:24.480
Only if you still feel like that

30:24.530 --> 30:26.010
by then.

30:26.340 --> 30:27.800
OK.

30:29.100 --> 30:30.560
Speaking of my life,

30:31.290 --> 30:32.170
you're the first man I saw

30:32.170 --> 30:34.200
since I could remember.

30:34.220 --> 30:35.530
Perhaps,

30:36.410 --> 30:38.270
you'll also be the last man I see

30:38.290 --> 30:39.600
in future.

30:41.460 --> 30:42.250
Maybe you're still young

30:42.250 --> 30:43.960
even by then.

30:48.770 --> 30:49.650
Shouldn't we discuss about

30:49.650 --> 30:51.170
finding the key in the imperial palace?

30:54.700 --> 30:55.960
Right.

30:56.340 --> 30:57.650
Go on.

31:05.010 --> 31:06.230
The problem is

31:06.250 --> 31:08.110
do you know where the Empress Dowager lives.

31:08.130 --> 31:09.370
No, I don't.

31:09.460 --> 31:10.360
Well then.

31:10.380 --> 31:11.770
You should find a chance to go to the imperial palace

31:11.770 --> 31:13.370
to figure out the route.

31:14.250 --> 31:15.480
What a coincidence!

31:15.500 --> 31:17.960
I'm going to the imperial palace tomorrow.

31:17.980 --> 31:18.910
How is that?

31:18.930 --> 31:20.960
Good. Remember to figure out the route.

31:21.930 --> 31:23.010
Isn't there anything in the world

31:23.010 --> 31:24.480
that can surprise you?

31:24.500 --> 31:25.720
No.

31:25.770 --> 31:28.560
Well, good for you.

31:29.340 --> 31:30.650
No words can express

31:30.650 --> 31:32.250
my admiration for you.

31:32.860 --> 31:34.030
Uncle.

31:34.050 --> 31:34.770
Do you find the climate especially dry

31:34.770 --> 31:36.390
in the capital city?

31:36.410 --> 31:37.500
Luckily, I'm ingenious.

31:37.500 --> 31:39.230
I made a humidifier myself.

31:39.250 --> 31:40.580
It has a mechanical structure
and is driven by hydraulic power.

31:40.580 --> 31:41.510
Someone's here.

31:41.530 --> 31:42.720
Who?

31:58.770 --> 31:59.750
Why are you here?

31:59.770 --> 32:01.410
Ruoruo left the door open for me.

32:07.980 --> 32:09.840
What's this?

32:12.130 --> 32:13.360
The climate in the capital city

32:13.380 --> 32:14.360
is drier than that of Danzhou,

32:14.380 --> 32:16.770
so I made a humidifier myself.

32:16.980 --> 32:18.650
Humidifier?

32:25.500 --> 32:27.560
Do you have anything for me?

32:28.820 --> 32:30.800
The starry sky is so beautiful tonight.

32:31.410 --> 32:32.620
Would you like to join me

32:32.620 --> 32:34.050
in watching the stars?

32:48.410 --> 32:50.770
As a child, I lived in the imperial palace.

32:51.340 --> 32:53.800
My father and mother couldn't visit me.

32:55.010 --> 32:56.560
Every night,

32:57.290 --> 32:58.050
I was alone

32:58.050 --> 33:00.560
in a really big room.

33:01.700 --> 33:03.480
From then on,

33:04.700 --> 33:07.170
I was particularly fond of watching the starry sky.

33:07.620 --> 33:09.480
Because I had nothing else to watch

33:10.010 --> 33:12.050
except for the starry sky.

33:32.380 --> 33:34.370
And my disease...

33:35.860 --> 33:37.770
the tuberculosis

33:38.010 --> 33:39.890
just couldn't be cured.

33:40.130 --> 33:41.650
I felt that

33:43.500 --> 33:45.770
I could die anytime.

33:46.380 --> 33:47.800
In the day,

33:47.820 --> 33:50.080
I talked to others with a smile.

33:51.100 --> 33:53.440
But actually, I was so scared.

33:56.290 --> 33:57.600
I'm here.

33:58.220 --> 33:59.840
I won't let you die.

34:01.700 --> 34:03.800
I dared not be close to others,

34:04.100 --> 34:05.600
for fear that

34:07.410 --> 34:09.920
if I died of disease suddenly,

34:09.940 --> 34:11.890
they might be heartbroken.

34:14.340 --> 34:16.000
But the fact is

34:16.580 --> 34:18.890
nobody wanted to be close to me.

34:19.940 --> 34:22.280
After all, I'm just a bastard.

34:22.730 --> 34:24.650
So am I.

34:25.420 --> 34:27.240
You're different.

34:27.290 --> 34:29.240
You've experienced a lot,

34:30.580 --> 34:32.930
but I was locked up in the imperial palace.

34:34.450 --> 34:35.970
I once heard that

34:36.660 --> 34:38.170
life is like

34:38.820 --> 34:41.080
walking on a road.

34:41.660 --> 34:43.430
You keep meeting different people

34:43.450 --> 34:45.170
and parting with them.

34:45.900 --> 34:47.600
I'm so envious of that.

34:50.820 --> 34:52.490
I've walked the way

34:53.620 --> 34:55.560
all by myself.

34:56.180 --> 34:56.730
Never have I met

34:56.730 --> 34:58.650
anyone else.

35:00.210 --> 35:02.800
I could only walk by myself

35:03.900 --> 35:06.450
step by step.

35:08.860 --> 35:10.450
I thought

35:12.380 --> 35:14.800
I would walk alone to death.

35:17.820 --> 35:19.520
But unexpectedly,

35:20.690 --> 35:22.450
you showed up.

35:25.340 --> 35:28.730
Fan Xian, it feels so good

35:30.420 --> 35:32.000
to have a company.

35:36.530 --> 35:38.650
I will always be here for you.

35:40.530 --> 35:42.560
But I'm so scared.

35:43.210 --> 35:45.370
I'm scared that one day you'll leave,

35:45.660 --> 35:47.730
and then I'll be all alone again.

35:47.900 --> 35:50.280
You won't be alone any more.

35:58.180 --> 35:59.690
I'm sorry.

36:00.770 --> 36:04.210
I lied to you about the outing today.

36:05.050 --> 36:06.120
I didn't tell you that

36:06.140 --> 36:08.690
my father wanted to test you.

36:10.580 --> 36:12.760
I don't know how can I express my regrets

36:13.100 --> 36:15.230
or how can I make it up to you.

36:15.250 --> 36:16.490
So,

36:16.860 --> 36:18.890
I could only sneak out

36:19.250 --> 36:20.730
and watch the starry night

36:21.970 --> 36:24.240
with you.

36:26.050 --> 36:27.370
Look!

36:27.690 --> 36:29.410
Isn't the starry sky

36:29.900 --> 36:31.760
especially beautiful tonight?

36:38.050 --> 36:39.560
Yes, indeed!

36:43.530 --> 36:45.240
In my heart,

36:45.940 --> 36:47.650
it's the most beautiful

36:47.690 --> 36:49.690
and precious thing.

36:50.530 --> 36:52.130
Besides this,

36:52.770 --> 36:55.240
I don't know what else I can give you.

37:06.970 --> 37:09.560
You've given me the entire starry sky.

37:10.450 --> 37:11.750
I want nothing

37:11.770 --> 37:13.490
but this.

37:17.140 --> 37:19.450
I won't lie to you anymore.

37:23.770 --> 37:25.410
Me, too.

37:26.530 --> 37:28.240
From today on,

37:29.180 --> 37:31.080
no more lies.

37:38.940 --> 37:40.320
Look!

37:43.420 --> 37:45.080
It's not as beautiful as you.

37:54.660 --> 37:56.240
We are among the boundless crowd

37:56.690 --> 37:59.210
as stars among the night sky.

38:02.900 --> 38:04.410
These days,

38:04.450 --> 38:06.750
I've been thinking about the story of

38:06.770 --> 38:09.080
one hundred branches of cherry blossoms you told me.

38:09.730 --> 38:11.010
I feel sorry

38:11.010 --> 38:12.690
for their love.

38:13.450 --> 38:15.040
Now

38:16.530 --> 38:17.380
I finally understand

38:17.380 --> 38:18.530
why you told me

38:18.530 --> 38:19.890
the story.

38:20.970 --> 38:22.250
Because among the boundless crowd,

38:22.250 --> 38:23.840
we are

38:24.580 --> 38:25.290
so lucky

38:25.290 --> 38:27.240
to meet each other.

38:30.820 --> 38:32.890
You don't want us to miss each other.

38:37.140 --> 38:38.410
We won't

38:38.970 --> 38:41.210
miss each other for sure.

39:04.970 --> 39:06.970
How about a hug before I leave?

39:52.560 --> 39:56.470
=Fan mansion=

40:15.420 --> 40:18.410
We've received an imperial decree to
summon you into the imperial palace.

40:20.340 --> 40:22.280
Summon who?

40:23.010 --> 40:24.510
This time,

40:24.530 --> 40:27.210
you'll mainly visit the imperial harem.

40:29.140 --> 40:30.370
It's you.

40:31.620 --> 40:33.270
Go with him this time.

40:33.290 --> 40:34.370
Fine.

40:34.450 --> 40:35.890
Can Ruoruo come with us?

40:37.820 --> 40:38.940
Your sister has never

40:38.940 --> 40:40.690
liked such occasions.

40:41.690 --> 40:43.040
I'd love to.

40:48.340 --> 40:49.690
Fine then.

40:51.010 --> 40:52.520
Me, too.

40:59.380 --> 41:00.340
No, I won't go.

41:00.340 --> 41:02.370
I don't like such occasions.

41:06.940 --> 41:07.860
When we go inside the imperial palace,

41:07.860 --> 41:08.380
help me remember

41:08.380 --> 41:09.560
the routes between different palaces.

41:09.580 --> 41:11.040
Pay attention to the details.

41:11.180 --> 41:12.030
OK.

41:12.050 --> 41:13.600
I might have to break into the imperial palace.

41:14.250 --> 41:15.730
Then I'll try my best to remember the details.

41:16.690 --> 41:17.930
Aren't you scared?

41:18.250 --> 41:20.000
Brother, whatever you want to do, I'll help you.

41:28.380 --> 41:29.690
Why are you following us?

41:31.770 --> 41:33.080
When you're in the imperial palace,

41:33.210 --> 41:34.950
will you request a consort to write something for me?

41:34.970 --> 41:35.990
Write what?

41:36.010 --> 41:36.970
Our Danbo Bookstore

41:36.970 --> 41:38.320
is about to open.

41:38.340 --> 41:40.640
With the name written by the imperial family,

41:40.660 --> 41:42.920
we'll be the Imperial Danbo Bookstore.

41:42.940 --> 41:43.950
By then,

41:43.970 --> 41:45.420
there must be a lot of customers.

41:45.420 --> 41:47.270
The word Imperial doesn't go with Danbo.
(Danbo means indifferent to fame and fortune in Chinese.)

41:47.290 --> 41:48.360
Then we can change the name.

41:48.380 --> 41:49.210
We open the bookstore

41:49.210 --> 41:50.880
to make money.

41:50.900 --> 41:52.080
In my opinion,

41:52.100 --> 41:53.650
we should call it Dali Bookstore.
(Dali means big profits in Chinese.)

41:58.290 --> 41:59.370
Get lost.

42:00.900 --> 42:02.040
Well.

42:04.450 --> 42:06.800
Do remember that.

42:06.900 --> 42:08.130
Don't forget.

42:08.620 --> 42:09.930
Brother!

42:23.450 --> 42:24.890
Haven't seen you for a long time.

42:24.970 --> 42:27.560
Madam, you're gorgeous.

42:28.140 --> 42:30.270
Eunuch, I'm so flattered.

42:30.290 --> 42:31.140
I wonder

42:31.140 --> 42:32.840
who want to see Xian'er today?

42:32.860 --> 42:34.880
Those who watched the princess grow up

42:34.900 --> 42:37.800
all want to see Mr. Fan.

42:37.860 --> 42:39.560
The Empress Dowager

42:39.580 --> 42:40.840
also wants to see him.

42:40.860 --> 42:43.690
But she'll see him after lunch.

42:44.340 --> 42:45.730
Who should we visit first?

42:45.860 --> 42:46.990
Madam, since you're here,

42:47.010 --> 42:50.210
you certainly should visit Consort Yi first.

42:50.380 --> 42:51.970
What about the empress?

43:14.880 --> 43:18.460
In the river of history,

43:18.480 --> 43:21.950
time goes round and round.

43:24.760 --> 43:28.100
Memories about the former and present lives

43:28.120 --> 43:32.190
join each other in an endless way.

43:34.080 --> 43:36.700
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:36.720 --> 43:38.960
one season follows another in a flash,

43:38.960 --> 43:41.460
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:41.480 --> 43:43.080
I just can't give up

43:43.080 --> 43:46.420
to be with you for my whole life.

43:46.440 --> 43:51.910
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:53.160 --> 43:55.710
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:56.000 --> 43:58.040
Year after year in the wandering,

43:58.040 --> 44:00.700
I count the remaining years.

44:00.720 --> 44:02.900
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:02.920 --> 44:04.910
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:05.200 --> 44:07.590
I never feel regretful.

44:07.640 --> 44:09.000
In such a chaotic world,

44:09.000 --> 44:11.980
I still miss you as ever.

44:12.000 --> 44:14.950
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:15.240 --> 44:17.300
With a gentle heart,

44:17.320 --> 44:19.980
I cherish our remaining years.

44:20.000 --> 44:21.520
Even though we have to go through

44:21.520 --> 44:24.030
all the hardships along the journey,

44:24.160 --> 44:31.350
you always stay by my side,

44:31.440 --> 44:34.110
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

